{"title":"Dune Scorpion","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 26 Scorpion that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (1.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .2 | venomDamage: 6</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/deathstalker-venom\">Deathstalker Venom</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>76</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>58</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above 